<%
  nodes, edges = @workflow.nodes.to_a, @workflow.edges.to_a
  by_id = nodes.index_by(&:id)
  ready = ->(step) { Folder.ready(step.transformation.makes) }
  hashtags = ->(tags) { tags.map { "##{it.name}" }.join(" ").presence }
  ref = ->(node) { "n#{node.id} #{node.step? ? %("#{node.label}") : node.label}" }
  ins = ->(node) { edges.select { it.to_id == node.id }.map { [ ref.(by_id[it.from_id]), (" (slot #{it.slot})" if it.slot) ].join } }
  outs = ->(node) { edges.select { it.from_id == node.id }.map { ref.(by_id[it.to_id]) } }
  output_folder = ->(step) { edges.map { by_id[it.to_id] if it.from_id == step.id }.find { it && !it.step? } }
  media_line = ->(media) do
    next "(deleted media)" unless media
    file = media.file.attached? ? "[#{media.file.filename}](#{rails_blob_url(media.file)})" : "no file yet"
    [ "[media #{media.id}](#{library_item_url(media)})", media.kind, file, "in #{media.folder.path}", hashtags.(media.tags) ].compact.join(" ")
  end
  item_line = ->(item) do
    case item
    when Prompt then %(prompt #{item.id} "#{item.name}" in #{item.folder.path}: #{item.body.presence&.squish&.truncate(300) || "(being written)"})
    when Review then %(review #{item.id} by #{item.customer_name}, #{item.rating}★: #{item.body.to_s.squish.truncate(300)})
    else media_line.(item)
    end
  end
  mermaid = ->(text) { %("#{text.to_s.gsub('"', "#quot;")}") }
  graph = nodes.reject(&:note?)
  notes = nodes.select(&:note?)
%>
# Workflow: <%= @workflow.name %>

- Canvas: <%= workflow_url(@workflow) %>
- Autorun: <%= @workflow.autorun ? "on, media landing in a start node starts a run of its own" : "off" %>
- Edited: <%= @workflow.updated_at.iso8601 %>
- Start nodes (play starts a run here): <%= @workflow.start_nodes.map { ref.(it) }.join(", ").presence || "none" %>
<% if @selected %>
- Selected node: <%= ref.(@selected) %>
<% end %>

How to read it (more in docs/WORKFLOWS.md): every node gives items of one kind: media, prompts or reviews. A media folder
gives its pinned media, else its newest N, having all its tags; a prompt folder all its prompts; Reviews its 5-star
reviews; a media node itself. A step batches its main kind (the first it takes): once per item, or all of them in one
step run (Image, Video, reels, LLM); each step run also picks one item of each other kind fed to it (a prompt at random,
the newest review). Each step run makes one item of the kind its step makes, landing in its first output folder, else
<%= Folder.ready.path %> (media) or <%= Folder.ready("prompt").path %> (prompts), media with the step's tags. Results
don't inherit their source's tags. A step starts once every node feeding it gives something.

## Graph

```mermaid
flowchart LR
<% graph.each do |node| %>
<% if node.step? %>
  n<%= node.id %>[<%= mermaid.([ node.label, node.transformation.options_label, hashtags.(node.tags) ].compact.join(" · ")) %>]
<% elsif node.library_media %>
  n<%= node.id %>([<%= mermaid.(node.label) %>])
<% else %>
  n<%= node.id %>[/<%= mermaid.(node.label) %>/]
<% end %>
<% end %>
<% edges.each do |edge| %>
  n<%= edge.from_id %> --><%= "|#{mermaid.(edge.slot)}|" if edge.slot %> n<%= edge.to_id %>
<% end %>
<% graph.select { it.step? && !output_folder.(it) }.group_by { ready.(it) }.each do |folder, steps| %>
  ready<%= folder.id %>[/<%= mermaid.("#{folder.path} (no output folder)") %>/]
<% steps.each do |step| %>
  n<%= step.id %> -.-> ready<%= folder.id %>
<% end %>
<% end %>
```

## Nodes
<% graph.each do |node| %>

<% if node.step? %>
<% t = node.transformation %>
### n<%= node.id %> · Step "<%= node.label %>"<%= " (selected)" if node == @selected %>

- Type: <%= t.type_label %> (`<%= t.kind %>`), <%= t.inputs == 1 ? "one input, one step run per #{t.takes.first}" : "takes all its inputs' #{t.takes.first.to_s.pluralize} in one step run" %>
- Takes: <%= t.takes.first.to_s.pluralize %> (main)<%= t.takes.drop(1).map { ", one #{it} per step run" }.join %>; makes: <%= t.makes.to_s.pluralize %>
- Options: <%= t.options_label %> `<%= t.options.to_json %>`
- Tags it sets on what it makes: <%= hashtags.(node.tags) || "none" %>
- From: <%= ins.(node).join(", ").presence || "nothing yet" %>
- To: <%= outs.(node).join(", ").presence || "nothing" %><%= ", results land in #{ready.(node).path}" unless output_folder.(node) %>
<% if t.slots %>
- Slots, in the order their media reach a step run: <%= t.slots.join(", ") %>
<% end %>
<% if t.layer %>
- Layer: <%= t.layer.name %>
<% end %>
<% if t.layer_steps.any? %>
- Layer steps: `<%= t.layer_steps.to_json %>`
<% end %>
<% if t.ai? %>

<%= t.makes == :prompt ? "Instruction (the input prompts are the message):" : "Prompt (a picked prompt's text is appended):" %>

~~~text
<%= t.body %>
~~~
<% end %>
<% if t.style %>

Style "<%= t.style.name %>", appended to the prompt:

~~~text
<%= t.style.body %>
~~~
<% end %>
<% elsif node.library_media %>
### n<%= node.id %> · Media <%= node.label %><%= " (selected)" if node == @selected %>

- Gives: <%= media_line.(node.library_media) %>
- To: <%= outs.(node).join(", ").presence || "nothing" %>
<% else %>
### n<%= node.id %> · Folder <%= node.label %> (<%= node.folder.kind %>)<%= " (selected)" if node == @selected %>

<% if outs.(node).any? %>
<% if node.media_folder? %>
- Gives: <%= node.pinned_media_ids.any? ? "its pinned media #{node.pinned_media_ids.join(", ")}" : "its newest #{node.take} media" %><%= " tagged #{hashtags.(node.tags)} (all of them)" if node.tags.any? %><%= ", only #{node.media_type.pluralize}" if node.media_type %>
<% elsif node.folder.prompt? %>
- Gives: all its prompts (<%= node.folder.prompts.written.count %>, shared ones plus the account's)
<% else %>
- Gives: the account's 5-star reviews, newest first
<% end %>
<% end %>
- From: <%= ins.(node).join(", ").presence || "nothing" %>
- To: <%= outs.(node).join(", ").presence || "nothing" %>
<% end %>
<% end %>
<% if notes.any? %>

## Notes

Sticky notes on the canvas; runs ignore them.
<% notes.each do |note| %>

### n<%= note.id %> · Note (<%= note.color %>)<%= " (selected)" if note == @selected %>

<%= note.note.lines.map { "> #{it}" }.join.presence || "> (blank)" %>
<% end %>
<% end %>

## Runs

Newest first; add `?run=<id>` to show another run in detail.

<% if @runs.empty? %>
No runs yet.
<% end %>
<% @runs.first(20).each do |run| %>
- <%= run.name %> (id <%= run.id %>)<%= " (shown)" if run == @run %>: <%= run.state || "started" %>, <%= pluralize(run.step_runs.size, "step run") %>, updated <%= run.updated_at.iso8601 %>
<% end %>
<% if @run %>

## <%= @run.name %> (id <%= @run.id %>): <%= @run.state || "started" %>

<% if @run.error %>
- Error: <%= @run.error %>
<% end %>
- Picks: <%= @run.picks.map { |id, media_ids| "n#{id}: media #{media_ids.join(", ")}" }.join("; ").presence || "none, so start folders give their pinned or newest" %>
- Started from: <%= @run.inputs.map { item_line.(it) }.join("; ").presence || "nothing" %>
- Ended with: <%= @run.outputs.map { item_line.(it) }.join("; ").presence || "nothing" %>
<% @step_runs.each do |step_run| %>

### Step run <%= step_run.id %> · <%= step_run.workflow_node ? ref.(step_run.workflow_node) : "deleted step" %>: <%= step_run.status %>

<% if (from = step_run.reused_from) %>
- Reused: the result of step run <%= from.id %><%= " in #{from.workflow_run.name} (id #{from.workflow_run.id})" if from.workflow_run %>, not made again
<% elsif step_run.duration %>
- Duration: <%= step_run.duration.round %> s<%= ", cost #{number_to_currency(step_run.cost, precision: 3)}" if step_run.cost %>
<% end %>
<% if step_run.error %>
- Error: <%= step_run.error %>
<% end %>
- In: <%= step_run.sources.map { item_line.(it) }.join("; ") %>
- Out: <%= item_line.(step_run.result) %>
<% if step_run.options.present? %>
- Options: `<%= step_run.options.to_json %>`
<% end %>
<% if step_run.prompt_text.present? && step_run.prompt_text != step_run.workflow_node&.transformation&.body %>

Prompt as sent:

~~~text
<%= step_run.prompt_text %>
~~~
<% end %>
<% end %>
<% end %>
